/span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__card\" href=\"https://formester.com/blog/how-to-make-a-questionnaire-in-google-forms/\">\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"17\"/></svg>\n</span>\n<div class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__text\">\n<h3 class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__title\">Questionnaire in Google Forms</h3>\n<p class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__sub\">Step-by-step guide</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__card\" href=\"https://formester.com/templates/categories/survey-forms/\">\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg>\n</span>\n<div class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__text\">\n<h3 class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__title\">Survey templates</h3>\n<p class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__sub\">Browse the gallery</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__card\" href=\"https://formester.com/features/conditional-logic/\">\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 3 6 21\"/><polyline points=\"18 3 18 9\"/><path d=\"M6 9c0 6 12 6 12 12\"/></svg>\n</span>\n<div class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__text\">\n<h3 class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__title\">Conditional logic</h3>\n<p class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__sub\">Branching for survey paths</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__card\" href=\"https://formester.com/google-forms-alternative/\">\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"/><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"/><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"/><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"/></svg>\n</span>\n<div class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__text\">\n<h3 class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__title\">Google Forms alternative</h3>\n<p class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__sub\">Better charts + dashboards</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"fmstr-cmp-pcg-rel__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n</a>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does Google Forms have pie charts?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. Google Forms automatically generates a pie chart for every multiple-choice and dropdown question. View it in the Responses tab in the live form editor.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I make a pie chart from Google Forms responses?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Open the form, click the Responses tab, scroll to the question. The pie chart appears automatically for multiple-choice questions. For full customization, send responses to Google Sheets and insert a custom chart there.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why is my Google Forms pie chart not showing?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Google Forms only shows pie charts for multiple-choice and dropdown questions. Short-answer, paragraph, and date questions show as response lists, not charts. Convert the question to multiple-choice to get a pie chart.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I customize the colors of a Google Forms pie chart?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Not in Google Forms directly. To customize colors, fonts, and labels, send responses to Google Sheets and create a custom chart in the Sheets chart editor.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I download a pie chart from Google Forms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"In the Responses tab, click the three-dot menu on the chart and choose Copy chart, or take a screenshot. For a higher-quality export, recreate the chart in Google Sheets and download as PNG or PDF.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I add a pie chart to a Google Form question?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No. Pie charts appear in the Responses tab, not in the live form. To show a pie chart inside the form (mid-quiz, post-submission), use Formester's result-page feature.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I make a pie chart in Google Sheets from Forms data?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Open the linked Google Sheet, select the response data range, click Insert then Chart, and choose Pie chart from the chart types. Customize colors and labels in the Chart editor.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I share a Google Forms pie chart with others?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. The pie chart in the Responses tab is visible to anyone with edit access to the form. To share publicly, screenshot the chart or publish the Google Sheets version to the web.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What's the difference between a pie chart and a bar chart in Google Forms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Both visualize the same data. Pie charts work best when comparing 2-5 categories that add to 100%. Bar charts work better for 6+ categories or when you want to show exact counts.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a better tool than Google Forms for visualizing responses?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Formester includes built-in summary analytics with pie, bar, and line charts plus filtering by date, respondent attribute, and answer. Worth it when you need real-time dashboards or per-segment breakdowns.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"How to Make a Pie Chart in Google Forms (3 Methods)\", \"description\": \"Make a pie chart in Google Forms 3 ways: built-in summary chart, Google Sheets chart, or export to a tool. Step-by-step screenshots and video.\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Harish Kumar\", \"url\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/harish-kumar2424/\"}, \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Formester\", \"logo\": {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://formester.com/logo.svg\"}}, \"dateModified\": \"2026-06-05\"}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://formester.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://formester.com/blog/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"How to Make a Pie Chart in Google Forms (3 Methods)\", \"item\": \"https://formester.com/blog/how-to-make-pie-charts-in-google-forms/\"}]}</script>",
